    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s4",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Media autem nocte clamer factus est, Ecce spon­ sus venit, xite obviam ei. Tunc surrexerunt omnes vir­ gines illæ, et ornaverunt lampandes sitas;",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s5",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et cum fatua­ rum virginum lampades exstingnerentur, rogaverunt reliquas in quarum vasis erat olcum, ut eis darent de oleo suo;",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s6",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et illæ dixerunt : Ne forte non sufficiat nobis et vobis, ite potius ad vendentes et emile vobis.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s7",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Dum autem irent emere, venit sponsus, et quæ paratæ erant intraverunt cum eo ad nuptias, et clansa est j inua.",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s8",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Venerunt postea reliquæ virgines dicentes : Do­ mine, Domine, aperi nobis; quibus dictum est : Ne­ scio unde estis.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s9",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod cum ait, Sponso moram faciente, dormitaverunt omnes et dormierunt, somnus llle mor­ tem significat.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s10",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Denique, sicut Apostolus ait, De dor- mientibus autem nolumus ignorare vos, fratres.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Media nox quando clamor factus est, magnum significat diem judicii; propter ignorantiam dictum est me­ dia nox, quia nemo scit quan o aut qua hara dies judicii veniat.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod autem ornnes virgines ornave­ runt lampades, et illæ fatuæ habuerunt aliquid olei, sed parum fnit, ut eis sufficere omnino non posset.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Denique statim exstinguere [exstingui] cæperunt. Unde quantum possumus cum Dei adjutorio laborare debomus.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s14",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "fratres charissimi, ut quia in oleo miseri­ cordia vel charitas intelligitur, tantum reponamus invasis animarum nostrarum,quanlum nobis sufficiat in æternum.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s15",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nemini sufficit parum, fratres dilectis­ simi, nisi qui forte prae paupertate plus dare n an prævalet;",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s16",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "plena animæ lucerna opus est, ut per cha­ ritatis oleum lumen nostrum luceat in æterum.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s17",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Cui Deus dedit largiorem substantiam quantum potest laxet manus ad eleemosynam, nec credat quod ei poss t sufficere parum,",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s18",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed se consideret unusquis­ que ex eo tempore quo sapere cœpit quantum de­ test pro his quæ male cogitavit, male locutus, vel male o, eratus est,",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s19",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "attendat multitudinem peccato­ ram, ei singulorum pretia diligenter appendet; videat quantum debeat pro me adaciis, pro juramen­ tis, pro perjuriis,",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s20",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "pro maledictis vel detractionibus, pro ebrietate, pro gut atque luxuria, pro cogitatio­ nibus surdidis, pro se monibus oliosis.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s21",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Consideret unusquisque ista omnia et his similia, quæ nec nume­ rari possunt, et tunc agnoscet quantas eum eleemo­ synas oporteat exercere,",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s22",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "qui etiamsi tot vendemus [ivti venderemur], nisi præpondera verit Dei miseri­ cordia, redimere cuncta peccata non possumus,",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s23",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s23",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "vel huunliter contrito et compuncto corde quantum pos­ sumus faciamus, et non pro laude humana, sed pro Dei præcepta [forte præcepto] et vitæ æternæ con­ templatione faciamus.",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s24",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s24",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Quod autem dixerunt virgines fatnæ sapientibus, Date nobis de olco vestro;",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s25",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s25",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et illæ responderunt, Ne forte non sufficiat nobis et vobis, hoc æstimo humiliter dicturi, quia tantus terror et tanta examinato erit in die judicii,",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s26",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s26",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "ut etiam ilii qui oleum misericordiæ se intelligunt abundantius præparasse, metuant ne eis possit ad omnia peccata redimenda sufficere.",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s27",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s27",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Illud vero quod dictum est, Ite potius ad vendentes et emite tobis, potest hoc de pa i- peribus intelligi.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s28",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s28",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ipsi sunt negotiatores qui oleum animarum lampadibus neces ariis [forte necessa­ rium] vendunt.",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s29",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s29",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Per ipsos enim hoc ncgotium Ch i- stus exercere consuevit. In opsis euim accipit terrena repensaturus aeterna.",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s30",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s30",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Deniqne sic ipse dixit : Quandiu fecistis uni ex minimis istis, mihi fecistis. Lam­ pades autem animx intelliguntur.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s31",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s31",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Vasa autem ila ubi oleum resetvatur, conscientiæ bonæ significantur. Quid est autem oleum in vasis habere, nisi imus in con­ scientra opera bona recondere?",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 522,
    "date_range": [
      502,
      542
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it#PL67.IT.1.s32",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/caesarius-arelatensis/pl67_47_it",
    "canonical_ref": "PL67.IT.1.s32",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et, quia opera bona alli faciunt pro Dei amore, alii pro cupiditate laudis huma­ næ, virgines illæ et quæ in corpore virgines erant,",
